 [m
[31m-Current phase:[m
[32m+[m[32mPettyCash is a Nextcloud-native petty-cash capture, review, settlement, audit, and reporting[m
[32m+[m[32mapplication. The application is implemented as one modular monolith and preserves the existing[m
[32m+[m[32m`pettycash` app ID and `OCA\\PettyCash` namespace.[m
 [m
