[32m+[m[32m## Supported environment[m
 [m
[31m-Business logic will be implemented after:[m
[31m-- Architecture design[m
[31m-- Data model design[m
[31m-- Workflow design[m
[32m+[m[32m- Nextcloud 34.x[m
[32m+[m[32m- PHP 8.2–8.5[m
[32m+[m[32m- MariaDB[m
[32m+[m[32m- Node.js 20.11, 22, or 24[m
[32m+[m[32m- Vue 3 and TypeScript 5[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Safe local workflow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project never owns the shared Nextcloud volumes or legacy `oc_pcash_*` tables. Do not reset,[m
[32m+[m[32mdrop, rename, or rewrite either while developing this application.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m./scripts/preflight.sh  # read-only environment and legacy-table inventory[m
[32m+[m[32mcomposer install[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm ci[m
[32m+[m[32mmake check[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm run build[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe preflight expects `docker-nextcloud-1` and `docker-db-1`; override their names with[m
[32m+[m[32m`PETTYCASH_NC_CONTAINER` and `PETTYCASH_DB_CONTAINER`. Browser tests use[m
[32m+[m[32m`PETTYCASH_BASE_URL` and are always run explicitly with `npm run test:e2e`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `lib/Domain`: deterministic business rules and immutable value objects[m
[32m+[m[32m- `lib/Application`: commands, queries, authorization, and ports[m
[32m+[m[32m- `lib/Infrastructure`: Nextcloud/database/storage/export adapters[m
[32m+[m[32m- `lib/Controller`: thin page and OCS transport adapters[m
[32m+[m[32m- `src`: Vue application; generated deployable assets are written to `js/` and `css/`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `specs/001-pettycash-v1-core`: specification, plan, contracts, and implementation tasks[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAll money is stored as integer minor units. Mutating requests use caller-supplied command UUIDs;[m
[32m+[m[32mbusiness audit and submitted revisions are append-only. See `docs/architecture.md` and[m
[32m+[m[32m`docs/operations.md` for operational constraints.[m
